---
title: Proposition 14
---
order: 14
---
short_label: VIII.14
---
sections:

#### prop_section ####
kind: proposition
----
statement: If a square measures a square, then the side also measures the side; and, if the side measures the side, then the square also measures the square.
----
proof:

Let {A} and {B} be square numbers, let {C} and {D} be their sides, and let {A} measure {B}.

I say that {C} also measures {D}.

